Drives its own private GC state (its own `gcBindMemory`/`gcInit`-bound arena),
exactly as `../gcspanfreelist` does, and every assertion is about that private
heap: how many spans its #3045 cache holds across idle collections, and how
many chunks a second burst costs the reserve. Objects it allocates are the
private collector's and invisible to the ambient one. `arena`/`roots` are read
again at the very end and printed as `rooted`, so both stay live through the
last ambient collection this program could see.
